      7 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اندلس</span></b>  <i>It</i> (a thing) <i>was,</i> or <i>became, concealed,</i>
or <i>hidden;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تدلّس</span></b> : (TA:) and ↓ the
latter, <i>he</i> (a man, TK) <i>concealed,</i> or <i>hid, himself;</i>
(TK;) syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تكتّم</span>. (K.)

